    "modifier_oracle_7_0": "<b><font color='#ff0000'>Remove Fate's Edict.</font></b> \n\n New Active Ability: Change of Fate's \n\n Warps the fate of the selected target, while the effect is active, all Healing Received deals Pure Damage, and all Damage Taken - Heals. Cannot be dispelled.\n\n Duration: 5 seconds \n Cooldown: 18 seconds",
