    "modifier_oracle_8_3": "Increased Attack Speed on Fortune's End targets: 35/70/<b><font color='#eabe10'>105</font></b> \n\n Duration: 8 seconds",
    "modifier_oracle_9_0": "Fortune's End can be cast on an area. \n\n Increase Fortune's End Range: 100/200",
    "modifier_oracle_9_1": "Fortune's End can be cast <b><font color='#eabe10'>on an area</font></b>. \n\n Increase Fortune's End Range: <b><font color='#eabe10'>100</font></b>/200",
    "modifier_oracle_9_2": "Fortune's End can be cast <b><font color='#eabe10'>on an area</font></b>. \n\n Increase Fortune's End Range: 100/<b><font color='#eabe10'>200</font></b>",
    "modifier_oracle_10_0": "Fortune's End does not need to be sustained, it procs instantly and with maximum power. \n\n Base Damage: 11",
    "modifier_oracle_10_1": "Fortune's End does not need to be sustained, it procs instantly and with <b><font color='#eabe10'>maximum</font></b> power. \n\n Base Damage: <b><font color='#eabe10'>11</font></b>",
    "modifier_oracle_11_0": "Fortune's End does not cost mana. \n\n Fortune's End deals Physical Damage, not Magic. \n\n Increase Fortune's End Damage: 150%/200%/250% of Agility",
    "modifier_oracle_11_1": "Fortune's End <b><font color='#eabe10'>does not cost</font></b> mana. \n\n Fortune's End deals <b><font color='#eabe10'>Physical</font></b> Damage, not Magic. \n\n Increase Fortune's End Damage: <b><font color='#eabe10'>150%</font></b>/200%/250% of Agility",
    "modifier_oracle_11_2": "Fortune's End <b><font color='#eabe10'>does not cost</font></b> mana. \n\n Fortune's End deals <b><font color='#eabe10'>Physical</font></b> Damage, not Magic. \n\n Increase Fortune's End Damage: 150%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>200%</font></b>/250% of Agility",
    "modifier_oracle_11_3": "Fortune's End <b><font color='#eabe10'>does not cost</font></b> mana. \n\n Fortune's End deals <b><font color='#eabe10'>Physical</font></b> Damage, not Magic. \n\n Increase Fortune's End Damage: 150%/200%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>250%</font></b> of Agility",
    "modifier_oracle_12_0": "Increase Fate's Edict Duration: 1 seconds",
    "modifier_oracle_12_1": "Increase Fate's Edict Duration: <b><font color='#eabe10'>1</font></b> seconds",
    "modifier_oracle_13_0": "<b><font color='#ff0000'>Remove Purifying Flames.</font></b> \n\n Lifesteal: 6%/12%/18% \n\n Spell Lifesteal: 6%/12%/18%",
    "modifier_oracle_13_1": "<b><font color='#ff0000'>Remove Purifying Flames.</font></b> \n\n Lifesteal: <b><font color='#eabe10'>6%</font></b>/12%/18% \n\n Spell Lifesteal: <b><font color='#eabe10'>6%</font></b>/12%/18%",
    "modifier_oracle_13_2": "<b><font color='#ff0000'>Remove Purifying Flames.</font></b> \n\n Lifesteal: 6%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>12%</font></b>/18% \n\n Spell Lifesteal: 6%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>12%</font></b>/18%",
    "modifier_oracle_13_3": "<b><font color='#ff0000'>Remove Purifying Flames.</font></b> \n\n Lifesteal: 6%/12%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>18%</font></b> \n\n Spell Lifesteal: 6%/12%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>18%</font></b>",
    "modifier_oracle_14_0": "New Passive Ability: Diviner's Deck \n\n Upon gaining this ability and every 90 sec. thereafter, the hero draws a random tarot card. They always know which card will come next. Only one card can be active at a time. \n\n <b>«Death»</b>: +40% Spell Damage \n<b>«Fool»</b>: +20% Gold Earned \n<b>«World»</b>: +40% Intelligence \n<b>«Lovers»</b>: +40% Healing Amplification \n<b>«Tower»</b>: Barrier against all damage types with 400 health (restores if no damage is taken for 7 sec.)",
    "modifier_oracle_14_1": "New Passive Ability: <b><font color='#eabe10'>Diviner's Deck</font></b> \n\n Upon gaining this ability and every 90 sec. thereafter, the hero draws a random tarot card. They always know which card will come next. Only one card can be active at a time. \n\n <b>«Death»</b>: <b><font color='#eabe10'>+40%</font></b> Spell Damage \n<b>«Fool»</b>: <b><font color='#eabe10'>+20%</font></b> Gold Earned \n<b>«World»</b>: <b><font color='#eabe10'>+40%</font></b> Intelligence \n<b>«Lovers»</b>: <b><font color='#eabe10'>+40%</font></b> Healing Amplification \n<b>«Tower»</b>: Barrier against all damage types with <b><font color='#eabe10'>400</font></b> health (restores if no damage is taken for 7 sec.)",
    "modifier_oracle_15_0": "If there are creeps within 300 radius of Purifying Flames' target, the ability will trigger on them an additional 1/2 times.\n\n Each hero level increases Spell Damage: 0.5%",
    "modifier_oracle_15_1": "If there are creeps within 300 radius of Purifying Flames' target, the ability will trigger on them an additional <b><font color='#eabe10'>1</font></b>/2 times.\n\n Each hero level increases Spell Damage: <b><font color='#eabe10'>0.5%</font></b>",
    "modifier_oracle_15_2": "If there are creeps within 300 radius of Purifying Flames' target, the ability will trigger on them an additional 1/<b><font color='#eabe10'>2</font></b> times.\n\n Each hero level increases Spell Damage: <b><font color='#eabe10'>0.5%</font></b>",
    "modifier_oracle_16_0": "Magic Resistance: 3%/6%/9% \n\n Armor: 2/4/6",
    "modifier_oracle_16_1": "Magic Resistance: <b><font color='#eabe10'>3%</font></b>/6%/9% \n\n Armor: <b><font color='#eabe10'>2</font></b>/4/6",
    "modifier_oracle_16_2": "Magic Resistance: 3%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>6%</font></b>/9% \n\n Armor: 2/<b><font color='#eabe10'>4</font></b>/6",
    "modifier_oracle_16_3": "Magic Resistance: 3%/6%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>9%</font></b> \n\n Armor: 2/4/<b><font color='#eabe10'>6</font></b>",
    "modifier_oracle_17_0": "New Active Ability: Rain of Destiny \n\n The hero summons rain around themselves that damages enemies and heals allies. All healing received under the rain is reduced for enemies and increased for allies. \n\n Damage/Healing per Second: 30 + 80% of Mana Regeneration \n Healing Modification: 15% \n Duration: 10 sec. \n Radius: 650 \n Cooldown: 40 sec. \n Mana Cost: 150",
    "modifier_oracle_17_1": "New Active Ability: <b><font color='#eabe10'>Rain of Destiny</font></b> \n\n The hero summons rain around themselves that damages enemies and heals allies. All healing received under the rain is reduced for enemies and increased for allies. \n\n Damage/Healing per Second: <b><font color='#eabe10'>30</font></b> + <b><font color='#eabe10'>80%</font></b> of Mana Regeneration \n Healing Modification: <b><font color='#eabe10'>15%</font></b> \n Duration: 10 sec. \n Radius: 650 \n Cooldown: 40 sec. \n Mana Cost: 150",
    "modifier_oracle_18_0": "When False Promise ends, enemies within a 500 radius take Pure Damage equal to 20%/30%/40% of the Damage Taken by the Hero over the duration of the ability.\n\n <b><font color='#ff0000'>Maximum damage of the ability is 2000.</font></b>",
    "modifier_oracle_18_1": "When False Promise ends, enemies within a 500 radius take Pure Damage equal to <b><font color='#eabe10'>20%</font></b>/30%/40% of the Damage Taken by the Hero over the duration of the ability.\n\n <b><font color='#ff0000'>Maximum damage of the ability is 2000.</font></b>",
    "modifier_oracle_18_2": "When False Promise ends, enemies within a 500 radius take Pure Damage equal to 20%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>30%</font></b>/40% of the Damage Taken by the Hero over the duration of the ability.\n\n <b><font color='#ff0000'>Maximum damage of the ability is 2000.</font></b>",
    "modifier_oracle_18_3": "When False Promise ends, enemies within a 500 radius take Pure Damage equal to 20%/30%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>40%</font></b> of the Damage Taken by the Hero over the duration of the ability.\n\n <b><font color='#ff0000'>Maximum damage of the ability is 2000.</font></b>",
    "modifier_oracle_19_0": "False Promise Cooldown Reduction: 6/12 seconds",
    "modifier_oracle_19_1": "False Promise Cooldown Reduction: <b><font color='#eabe10'>6</font></b>/12 seconds",
    "modifier_oracle_19_2": "False Promise Cooldown Reduction: 6/<b><font color='#eabe10'>12</font></b> seconds",
    "modifier_oracle_20_0": "Purifying Flames does not Heal Enemies. \n\n Increase Purifying Flames Damage: 40%/80% of Mana Regeneneration",
    "modifier_oracle_20_1": "Purifying Flames does not Heal Enemies. \n\n Increase Purifying Flames Damage: <b><font color='#eabe10'>40%</font></b>/80% of Mana Regeneneration",
    "modifier_oracle_20_2": "Purifying Flames does not Heal Enemies. \n\n Increase Purifying Flames Damage: 40%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>80%</font></b> of Mana Regeneneration",
    "modifier_oracle_21_0": "If False Promise is not on cooldown, then the ability will automatically trigger on 1 Health. \n\n At the end of the False Promise effect, the hero cannot die. Instead, he is left with 10% of his Max Health.",
    "modifier_oracle_21_1": "If False Promise is not on cooldown, then the ability will <b><font color='#eabe10'>automatically</font></b> trigger on 1 Health. \n\n At the end of the False Promise effect, the hero cannot die. Instead, he is left with <b><font color='#eabe10'>10%</font></b> of his Max Health."
  },
